// from reader JSON + Noakhali notes (7001 source rows -> 6904 entries,
// 37724 class-rates, verified 0-mismatch against reader data).
// 63 office entries cover 64 checklist entries: chauddagram-gunabati is ONE
// combined schedule (see verdict below); Bijoyanagar (Brahmanbaria) is
// BLOCKED (no schedule file on the site) and has no entry.
// - SHARED-DOC VERDICT (-45/-52): the two files are md5-identical (one
//   18-page Chauddagram book, cover office চৌদ্দগ্রাম). The -52
//   transcription is canonical: full union-section thana + rule-correct
//   বাড়ী handling. The -45 transcription is DROPPED: it maps
//   বসত বাড়ী/ছাট -> বাড়ী (404 rows), violating the exact-name rule,
//   and carries no thana. Correction memos on pp.2-3 are NOT applied:
//   every memo value conflicts with the main table (several by 10x,
//   suggesting memo typos) and supersession is unverifiable; memo items
//   are recorded in rates-chattogram-batch3.md for Pankaj.
// - COLLISION RULES (extends batch 2): distinct thana -> variants[];
//   distinct JL -> "(JL <jl>)" suffix; poura-vs-other pair -> " (পৌর)"
//   suffix on the poura row; own-kromik in notes -> "(ক্রম <n>)";
//   distinct union in notes -> variants[] by union (city rows:
//   thana 'কুমিল্লা সিটি কর্পোরেশন', as in Sadar Dakshin);
//   Begumganj same-JL union pairs -> transliterated union suffix
//   (Jirtali=জিরতলী, Alaiyarpur=আলাইয়ারপুর, Rajganj=রাজগঞ্জ);
//   Ramu -> "(ক্রম <n>)" from book order (proven: notes referencing
//   krom 1,2,3,4,9,14,17/18/24,23 all sit at index+1).
// - CHATKHIL (no distinguisher in delivered data): গোবিন্দপুর JL-82
//   pair conflicts (same name, same JL, different rates) -> base entry
//   rates:{} (manual path only) + recoverable 'গোবিন্দপুর (JL 103)';
//   টবগা (both JL 56, conflicting) -> base rates:{} only.
// - NOAKHALI provenance: no consolidated reader JSON existed on disk;
